          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"A sensory, premium sound bath experience led by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#0f1724; --bg2:#071024; --accent:#b9f2ff; --muted:#9fb3c8; --card:#0b1220; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --radius:14px; --pad:22px; --maxw:960px;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial; color:#e6f7ff;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1) 0%,var(--bg2) 60%);}\\n    .canvas{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}\\n    .pattern-svg{width:160%;height:160%;opacity:0.12;transform:translate(-10%,-8%) rotate(6deg)}\\n    header{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto 24px;padding:0 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b9f2ff22,#7de0ff11);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);font-size:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(6,10,20,0.6)}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:15px}\\n    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}\\n    main{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:22px auto;padding:28px;}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:26px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,12,0.6)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.6px;color:#e9fbff}\\n    .kicker{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5}\\n    .facilitator{font-weight:700;color:#f7ffff;margin-top:12px}\\n    .venue{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:6px}\\n    .meta small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n    .instruments{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}\\n    .chip{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .side-cta{position:relative}\\n    .price-pill{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#102034,#1a2738);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center}\\n    .price-pill h3{color:var(--accent);margin:0;font-size:18px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7de0ff,#b9f2ff);color:#04202a;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\\n    .section{margin-top:20px}\\n    footer{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:28px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center}\\n    /* small responsive */\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.side-cta{order:2}.pattern-svg{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"canvas\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <!-- Unique inline SVG pattern for about page (original) -->\\n    <svg class=\\\"pattern-svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 800\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"gA\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#84e6ff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b6f5ff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.04\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n        <pattern id=\\\"pA\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(18)\\\">\\n          <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"16\\\" cy=\\\"16\\\" r=\\\"3\\\" fill=\\\"#b9f2ff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"64\\\" cy=\\\"64\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\" fill=\\\"#7de0ff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.09\\\"/>\\n          <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#b9f2ff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.03\\\"/>\\n        </pattern>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#gA)\\\"/>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#pA)\\\"/>\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary navigation\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private Sessions</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Our Story</div>\\n        <h1>Slow sound, precise care — a curated journey</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We craft sensory landscapes using resonant instruments and intentional pacing. {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} blends breath, sound, and space to guide groups toward deep restoration in {{VENUE_NAME}}, {{CITY}}.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"facilitator\\\">Led by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"venue\\\">Hosted at {{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"section\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 8px\\\">What we weave</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 10px\\\">Sessions are layered: grounding breathwork, an invitation, sonic immersion, and a gentle re-entry. Expect subtle dynamics that support a meditative, premium sensory experience.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"instruments\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Crystal singing bowls</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Wind chimes (hand-tuned)</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"chip\\\">Monochord drone</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"section\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 8px\\\">The flow, briefly</h3>\\n          <ol style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 0 18px;line-height:1.6\\\">\\n            <li>Arrive & settle: soft light and gentle orientation.</li>\\n            <li>Grounding: breath + intention (5–8 minutes).</li>\\n            <li>Main immersion: layered soundscapes (30–45 minutes).</li>\\n            <li>Transition: a guided reawakening and reflection (8–12 minutes).</li>\\n          </ol>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card side-cta\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"price-pill\\\">\\n          <h3>Next gathering</h3>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">What to bring</strong>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Yoga mat or floor cushion</li>\\n            <li>Light blanket and eye cover</li>\\n            <li>Water bottle & an open mind</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">Accessibility note</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">We welcome sensory needs—reach out at {{EMAIL}} or {{PHONE}} for accommodations.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card section\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 10px\\\">Our philosophy</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6\\\">Sound is a vessel. We design each moment so that sound leads, but you remain in control. The environment is intentionally minimal: soft lighting, warm floor mats, and subtle aromas when requested. Each session balances precision and spaciousness to invite a premium, sensory-first experience.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Gentle sound experiences in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"faq.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>FAQ — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Questions answered: flow, contraindications, what to bring, and how to prepare for a premium sound bath.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#071225;--card:#0d1520;--accent:#c1f7ff;--muted:#98b6c6}\\n    html,body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, #0a1a2a 0%, var(--bg) 40%), var(--bg);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial;color:#eaf9ff}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:20px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9ef0ff22,#78dfff11);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);margin-left:14px;text-decoration:none}\\n    main{margin-top:16px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:20px;border-radius:12px}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .faq-item{margin-bottom:14px}\\n    summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:#eaf9ff;list-style:none}\\n    details[open] summary{color:var(--accent)}\\n    details p{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0}\\n    .aside .chip{display:block;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7de0ff,#b9f2ff);color:#04202a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    /* unique decorative svg in the corner */\\n    .corner-svg{position:fixed;right:16px;bottom:16px;width:160px;opacity:0.09}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.corner-svg{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Questions & practicals</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Start</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Upcoming</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h1>Frequently asked</h1>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Short answers for a thoughtful arrival. If your question is personal, email us at <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <details class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <summary>What should I bring?</summary>\\n              <p>Bring a yoga mat or a thick floor cushion, a blanket, and an eye pillow if you have one. Dress in comfortable layers—the environment is kept warm but you may feel cool during stillness.</p>\\n            </details>\\n\\n            <details class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <summary>What is the session flow?</summary>\\n              <p>We begin with a brief orientation and centering breathwork, then move into a 30–45 minute sound immersion, concluding with a guided re-entry and optional reflection. Arrival 10–15 minutes early is appreciated.</p>\\n            </details>\\n\\n            <details class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <summary>Are there contraindications?</summary>\\n              <p>Sound baths are generally safe, but please avoid attending if you have severe uncontrolled epilepsy, recent head injury, or if you are currently pregnant without medical clearance. If you have implants or medical devices sensitive to vibration or metal (e.g., cochlear implants), contact us before booking. This information is not a substitute for medical advice—consult your provider.</p>\\n            </details>\\n\\n            <details class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <summary>Will I fall asleep?</summary>\\n              <p>Many guests drift into deep rest—that\\u2019s normal. The experience is non-religious and you are always free to rest or participate as you wish. After the session we allow time for gentle reintegration.</p>\\n            </details>\\n\\n            <details class=\\\"faq-item\\\">\\n              <summary>What instruments are used?</summary>\\n              <p>Instruments vary by facilitator and event. Common tools include gongs, tuning forks, and hand chimes. Each event lists the specific instrumentation.</p>\\n            </details>\\n\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <aside class=\\\"card aside\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"chip\\\"><strong style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">Arrival tips</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Arrive hydrated, limit caffeine before a session, and silence phones. We provide extra blankets and bolsters when available.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"chip\\\"><strong style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">Safety & comfort</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">If loud low frequencies bother you, mention this when booking. We can tailor intensity for sensitivity.</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Reserve a spot</a>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </div>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px;text-align:center\\\">Questions not listed? Email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> — we reply within 48 hours.</footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <!-- Decorative unique svg for FAQ page -->\\n  <svg class=\\\"corner-svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"fG\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#7de0ff\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#b9f2ff\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <g fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#fG)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" opacity=\\\"0.7\\\">\\n      <path d=\\\"M10 180 C50 120, 150 120, 190 60\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"30\\\" cy=\\\"150\\\" r=\\\"6\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"150\\\" cy=\\\"70\\\" r=\\\"5\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Reserve — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reserve your place for a sound bath or book a private session with {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} in {{CITY}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#07121a;--card:#071826;--accent:#aef6ff;--muted:#9bb9c9}\\n    html,body{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto;color:#eafcff;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#06101a 0%, #07121a 60%)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:20px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:12px}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    label{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}\\n    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:#eafcff}\\n    .btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7de0ff,#b9f2ff);color:#04202a;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .alt-nav{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"alt-nav\\\">Reserve — intimate & corporate offerings</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Events</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Help</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0;color:var(--accent)\\\">Reserve your spot or request a private session</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Choose a public sound bath seat or request 1:1, couples, or corporate sound design. We tailor tone, duration, and instrument palette for each booking.</p>\\n\\n        <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"POST\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"type\\\">I am booking</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"type\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"event\\\">A seat at the next group event</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"private-1\\\">Private 1:1 session</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"couples\\\">Couples session</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"corporate\\\">Corporate / team sound immersion</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"date\\\">Preferred date</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"date\\\" name=\\\"date\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}} or 2026-03-02\\\" />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"notes\\\">Notes / contraindications</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"notes\\\" name=\\\"notes\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us about sensitivities, pregnancy, implants, or anything else\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n          <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request booking</button>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">Booking note</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">Private sessions can be in-studio or on-site. For corporate bookings we provide guided sound journeys of varying lengths and optional reflection segments. We will follow up to confirm details and payments via {{EMAIL}}.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"color:var(--accent);margin:0\\\">Offerings & pricing</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Public gatherings are priced per person; private sessions vary by length and location. Typical instruments included for private offerings: monochord, crystal bowls, and wind chimes—each tailored to the group's needs.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Group seat</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">$35–55</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Private 1:1 (45 min)</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">$125</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Couples (60 min)</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">$220</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">What to expect</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0\\\">We begin with a short consultation to adjust intensity. Sound instrumentation for private bookings may include: monochord drone, crystal bowls, and soft chimes. You will receive guidance for positioning and post-session re-entry.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-direction:column\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email us to arrange</a>\\n          <a style=\\\"background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;text-align:center\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px;text-align:center\\\">Questions about booking? Contact <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
